[327.226356, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[35m1.\u001b[39m Low-priority experiments fill available GPU capacity\u001b[23X\r\n  \u001b[36m2.\u001b[39m Inference HPA scales up under load, evicting experiments\u001b[19X\r\n  \u001b[31m3.\u001b[39m Critical pre-training job preempts even inference servers\u001b[18X\u001b[4;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mClusters: us-east1 (8 GPUs) + us-west3 (8 GPUs) = 16 GPUs total\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[15X\u001b[6;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r▸ Initial GPU state\u001b[39m\u001b[9;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1meast1\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[39m░░░░░░]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m0t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m6 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[11;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1mwest3\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[39m░░░░░░]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m0t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m6 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[12;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2mLegend: \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=inference \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=training ░=free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[13;80H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  ↵ Press Enter to continue...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[14;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r\n▸ Step 1a: Submitting pre-training job (6 replicas x 1 GPU, 10min duration)\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[17;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mPriority: training-critical (2000) — will hold GPUs through the demo\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[19;80H\u001b[1K\r\njobset.jobset.x-k8s.io/pre-training-1 created\u001b[35X\u001b[21;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m pre-training-1 submitted to east1\u001b[23;80H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  ↵ Press Enter to continue...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[24;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r\n▸ Step 1b: Scheduling 40 low-priority experiments (1 GPU each, 60s duration)\u001b[39m\u001b[4X\u001b[27;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mSubmitting to management cluster → MultiKueue distributes across fleet\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[8X\u001b[29;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  Submitted \u001b[1m40\u001b(B\u001b[m/40 jobs...\u001b[31;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mWaiting for jobs to be admitted and dispatched...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[29X\u001b[33;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1meast1\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[35m██████\u001b[39m]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m6t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m0 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[34;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1mwest3\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[35m██████\u001b[39m]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m6t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m0 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2mLegend: \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=inference \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=training ░=free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36;80H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  ↵ Press Enter to continue...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r\n▸ Step 2: Starting inference load test → HPA will scale up and evict experiments\u001b[39m\u001b[40;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mLaunching load_test.py (concurrency=12000, max-tokens=768, target=east1)\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[6X\u001b[42;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m Load test started\r\n  \u001b[2mKV-cache will fill → HPA scales inference pods → experiments evicted\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[45;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mMonitoring GPU state (load takes ~60s to saturate KV-cache)...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[16X\u001b[47;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m── 17:59:00 ──\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[49;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1meast1\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[35m██████\u001b[39m]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m6t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m0 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[50;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1mwest3\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[35m██████\u001b[39m]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m6t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m0 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[51;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2mLegend: \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=inference \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=training ░=free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[52;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2m── 17:59:17 ──\u001b(B\u001b[m\u0