[328.877952, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[36m2.\u001b[39m Inference HPA scales up under load, evicting experiments\u001b[19X\r\n  \u001b[31m3.\u001b[39m Critical pre-training job preempts even inference servers\u001b[18X\u001b[3;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mClusters: us-east1 (8 GPUs) + us-west3 (8 GPUs) = 16 GPUs total\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[15X\u001b[5;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r▸ Initial GPU state\u001b[39m\u001b[8;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1meast1\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[39m░░░░░░]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m0t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m6 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[1mwest3\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[39m░░░░░░]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m0t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m6 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[11;80H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[2mLegend: \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=inference \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=training ░=free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[12;80H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  ↵ Press Enter to continue...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[13;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r\n▸ Step 1a: Submitting pre-training job (6 replicas x 1 GPU, 10min duration)\u001b[39m\u001b[5X\u001b[16;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mPriority: training-critical (2000) — will hold GPUs through the demo\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[10X\u001b[18;80H\u001b[1K\r\njobset.jobset.x-k8s.io/pre-training-1 created\u001b[35X\u001b[20;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m pre-training-1 submitted to east1\u001b[22;80H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r  ↵ Press Enter to continue...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[23;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\r\n▸ Step 1b: Scheduling 40 low-priority experiments (1 GPU each, 60s duration)\u001b[39m\u001b[4X\u001b[26;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mSubmitting to management cluster → MultiKueue distributes across fleet\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[8X\u001b[28;80H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r  Submitted \u001b[1m40\u001b(B\u001b[m/40 jobs...\u001b[30;80H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[2mWaiting for jobs to be admitted and dispatche